gitls (0.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Watch mode: collapsible category folders with aggregated status and cursor
    navigation; new categories config key.
  * Default status table sorted alphabetically.
  * Robustness fixes: EINTR retries for read()/waitpid(), SIGWINCH handling,
    signal blocking in worker threads, wcwidth-style display width.

 -- Sven Siepermann <sven@siepermann.dev>  Thu, 27 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000

